# Scene seam-2to1 (test/README.md): the hldemo2 -> hldemo1 elevator switch
# (landmark hldemo1to2, USEONLY: button #92 closes the doors, door #89 fires
# eledoordelaymm -> changetohldemo1) and the hldemo1 return arrival up to
# the car doors opening (changetarget elestartmm, 8.5 s): uplink.route lines
# 649-671 (route ops 463-478). New Game on hldemo2: the car's doors
# (startele1) are shut: the outside button opens them first.
# scene-window: uplink elevator-return 479
startmap hldemo2
waitmap hldemo2 60
# the route's player has the suit here (hldemo1's item_suit): drop it on
# him (HLSDK CBaseEntity::Create, touch pickup)
setpos -416 210 196 0 90
wait 0.3
drop item_suit -416 210 196
wait 1
# the car's doors (startele1, wait -1) open as the first visit's elestartmm
# left them: the outside button #93 (model *25, x -368..-366, y -256..-240);
# the open door fires its target button_lock, the master of the car's
# button #92
setpos -330 -248 196 10 180
wait 0.3
+use
wait 0.3
-use
waitmoved startele1 5
wait 1.5
setpos -470 -130 196 0 180
wait 1
stats begin
shot elevator-return
# button #92 (master button_lock): doors close, door #89 at the bottom fires
# eledoordelaymm -> changetohldemo1 (USEONLY trigger_changelevel)
setpos -440 -100 196 10 20
wait 0.3
+use
wait 0.3
-use
waitmap hldemo1 30
shot seam4-at

# ---- E: hldemo1 return → garg finale → end section (derived on the old tree's host build) ----
# --- Segment E: hldemo1 return visit -> end of demo ---------------------
# Arrive in the start elevator: seam switch (landmark hldemo1to2).
# changetarget elestartmm opens the car doors (startele1) after 8.5 s.
waitnear -2488 -100 196 1 0
look 0 0
shot hldemo1-return
stats hldemo1-return
waitmoved startele1 20
stats end
wait 0.2
pass
